{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54829","headline":"兵要望江南 占蜂第十七（京本列第十一○五首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占蜂第十七（京本列第十一○五首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军下寨，蜂蝶遍天飞，防有贼来攻我寨，急（首本作「忽」，兹从辛本、川本）须固守莫迟回，主将要先知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54829.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54829","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}